  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "So I had an idea for how vrchat can decouple the age verification price from vrc+ and change the price however they want whenever they want so that it isn't tied to the subscription model exclusively. \n\nPlace a paid option on the vrc store for a age verification token/ticket or something of the sort that you can \"redeem\" for the payment option for age verification. You can still keep the subscription system in place as a bonus for vrc+ subscribers to get a free verification with their subscription, but not make it a required thing just to go through the system once. \n\nWhat do you think about this idea?",
